    "In my dream, I became invisible and found myself in a crowded shopping mall, feeling as if I were walking on the moon. Without any clothes, I ran around freely, my body feeling light, which made it easy to jump. This sense of freedom was exhilarating. As I moved through the bustling crowd, people went about their shopping, unaware of my presence and seemingly unfazed by items moving around on their own. The experience was surreal, highlighting my newfound invisibility and the weightless sensation that": [
